{"id":"17518c2952ef83e1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-nc1.md","title":"NC¹","display":"df-nc1 — NC¹","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-nc1","aliases":["28-df-nc1","NC1"],"display":"df-nc1 — NC¹","depends_on":["[[28-df-nc]]","[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]"],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.24; Example 6.26","source_printed_pages":"117–118","source_pdf_pages":"143–144","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-nc1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-nc1</span><span>NC1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nc1 — NC¹"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"348985e8f68576a3\" href=\"?note=348985e8f68576a3\" title=\"28-df-nc\">28-df-nc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaa0de797e94fa6b\" href=\"?note=eaa0de797e94fa6b\" title=\"28-df-uniform-circuit-family\">28-df-uniform-circuit-family</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 6.24; Example 6.26"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"117–118"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"143–144"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NC}^k\">\\(\\mathbf{NC}^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BF}\">\\(\\operatorname{BF}\\)</span> 与电路参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"348985e8f68576a3\" href=\"?note=348985e8f68576a3\" title=\"28-df-nc\">28-df-nc</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LU}\">\\(\\operatorname{LU}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"eaa0de797e94fa6b\" href=\"?note=eaa0de797e94fa6b\" title=\"28-df-uniform-circuit-family\">28-df-uniform-circuit-family</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}\">\\(\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}\\)</span> 为本节点定义的对数空间一致子类；无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}\">\\(\\mathbf{NC}^{1}\\)</span> 沿用书中的非一致约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}=\\left.\\mathbf{NC}^{k}\\right|_{k=1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NC}^{1}=\\left.\\mathbf{NC}^{k}\\right|_{k=1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{LU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle))]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [&amp;\\operatorname{LU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle))]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>旧文将一致版本写成 NC¹，同时只在 Remark 要求有界扇入，导致与 NC 节点冲突；现将两个版本分开。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 6.24; Example 6.26，印刷页 117–118；PDF 页 143–144。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-nc","status":"resolved","id":"348985e8f68576a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-nc]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-uniform-circuit-family","status":"resolved","id":"eaa0de797e94fa6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-nc","status":"resolved","id":"348985e8f68576a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NC}^k$、$\\operatorname{BF}$ 与电路参数见 [[28-df-nc]]；$\\operatorname{LU}$ 见 [[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-uniform-circuit-family","status":"resolved","id":"eaa0de797e94fa6b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NC}^k$、$\\operatorname{BF}$ 与电路参数见 [[28-df-nc]]；$\\operatorname{LU}$ 见 [[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf{NC}^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LU}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NC}^{1}=\\left.\\mathbf{NC}^{k}\\right|_{k=1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathbf{NC}^{1}_{\\mathrm L}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*:\\exists(C_n)_n\\in\\mathbf{BoolCircFam}\\ \\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\ [&\\operatorname{LU}((C_n)_n)\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ (\\operatorname{BF}(C_n)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{size}(C_n)\\le c(n+1)^a\\land\\operatorname{depth}(C_n)\\le c\\lceil\\log_2(n+2)\\rceil\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\ (x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{out}_{C_n}(x)=\\langle1\\rangle))]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1667,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"一致性与电路类：[[28-df-uniform-circuit-family]]、[[28-df-nc]]、[[28-df-nc1]]、[[28-df-ac0]]、[[28-df-tc0]]、[[28-df-p-poly]]。"}],"outgoing":["348985e8f68576a3","eaa0de797e94fa6b"]}